-- Motion basics: fade in and out, and easing on a glide.
create a video called fade-ease, 1080 by 1080, on #14121a, 4 s long.
make a card called ball from cardstock, 200 by 200, at 200 300.
make a card called title from cardstock, 700 by 220, at 540 760.
write "Bounce" called word in Lilita One, at 350 150, size 120.
on the ball.
enamel the card in a radial gradient from #fff6c9 to #ff7a3d.
on the title.
enamel the card in a gradient from #3a1c71 to #d76d77 to #ffaf7b, angled 0.
enamel the word in #1b1145.
glide the ball to 880 300, at 0.5 s, over 1.4 s, bounce.
fade in the title at 0.4 s, over 0.8 s.
fade out the title at 3.2 s, over 0.6 s.
